{
    "title": "Save the Doge",
    "description": "Have you ever wanted an emotional draw save puzzle game to challenge your brain and your talent for drawing?\r\nDoge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 is a classic game. Watch out! The cute dog is in danger. The evil bees have come out to sting him. The only way you can save the dog is to draw a line to stop those bees.\r\nYou draw lines to create walls that protect the dog from attacks by bees in the hive. Hold it on and you will win. Not only bees can hurt him. The dog must also overcome bombs, lava, spikes, water ... to get to safety. Please help him!\r\nUse your brain to save the doge. Dog Rescue - Pet Draw Puzzle will help you train your brain effectively.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n\ud83d\udc36 Draw 1 line to save the puppy and finish the level.\r\nMake sure u can solve the puzzle in 1 continuous line. Press to draw out your line then lift your finger once you finish drawing.\r\n\ud83d\udc36 Make sure your line not hurt the Doge you protect.\r\nRemember NOT draw line crossing Doge you protect. Just draw in blank space.\r\n\ud83d\udc36 Each level can have more than 1 answer.\r\nDraw by wild imagination! Not only a test IQ, but also to have creativity in every puzzle.\r\n\r\nDoge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 FEATURES:\r\n\ud83d\udc36  Dynamic gameplay.\r\n\ud83d\udc36  Cute, funny characters.\r\n\ud83d\udc36  Engaging soundtracks.\r\n\ud83d\udc36  Unlimited playtime.\r\n\ud83d\udc36  Excellent way to pass time.\r\n\r\nNot only save your dog, but also you can save other animals when changing many types of memes.\r\nShare with your friends and save the pets together!\r\nDoge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 is a draw save puzzle games. You draw 1 line with your fingers to create walls that protect the doge. You need to draw to save the doge with the painted wall for 10 seconds during the attack of the bees. Remember to use your brain to save the dog.\r\nFind out different surprising, interesting, unexpected, and even hilarious drawing solutions to save the dog!\r\nWelcome to play our Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023, if you have any comments about the game you can give us feedback, thank you for your participation.\r\nImmerse yourself in the interesting world of save the puppy! Do you have what it takes to play this game? Download Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 to save your puppy from bees and relax your mind now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have you ever wanted an emotional draw save puzzle game to challenge your brain and your talent for drawing?<br>Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 is a classic game. Watch out! The cute dog is in danger. The evil bees have come out to sting him. The only way you can save the dog is to draw a line to stop those bees.<br>You draw lines to create walls that protect the dog from attacks by bees in the hive. Hold it on and you will win. Not only bees can hurt him. The dog must also overcome bombs, lava, spikes, water ... to get to safety. Please help him!<br>Use your brain to save the doge. Dog Rescue - Pet Draw Puzzle will help you train your brain effectively.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br>\ud83d\udc36 Draw 1 line to save the puppy and finish the level.<br>Make sure u can solve the puzzle in 1 continuous line. Press to draw out your line then lift your finger once you finish drawing.<br>\ud83d\udc36 Make sure your line not hurt the Doge you protect.<br>Remember NOT draw line crossing Doge you protect. Just draw in blank space.<br>\ud83d\udc36 Each level can have more than 1 answer.<br>Draw by wild imagination! Not only a test IQ, but also to have creativity in every puzzle.<br><br>Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 FEATURES:<br>\ud83d\udc36  Dynamic gameplay.<br>\ud83d\udc36  Cute, funny characters.<br>\ud83d\udc36  Engaging soundtracks.<br>\ud83d\udc36  Unlimited playtime.<br>\ud83d\udc36  Excellent way to pass time.<br><br>Not only save your dog, but also you can save other animals when changing many types of memes.<br>Share with your friends and save the pets together!<br>Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 is a draw save puzzle games. You draw 1 line with your fingers to create walls that protect the doge. You need to draw to save the doge with the painted wall for 10 seconds during the attack of the bees. Remember to use your brain to save the dog.<br>Find out different surprising, interesting, unexpected, and even hilarious drawing solutions to save the dog!<br>Welcome to play our Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023, if you have any comments about the game you can give us feedback, thank you for your participation.<br>Immerse yourself in the interesting world of save the puppy! Do you have what it takes to play this game? Download Doge Draw : Save the Dog 2023 to save your puppy from bees and relax your mind now!",
